        normal(" instance. It is the first meaningful object constructed and the last to be destroyed. It owns the only GUI engine the process will ever have, drives it through a strictly sequenced lifecycle, and enforces that no step in that sequence is ever taken out of order or repeated. Nothing about the GUI framework, the window infrastructure, or any downstream subsystem is visible to it \u2014 it knows only that an engine exists, that the engine is in some valid state, and that it is "),
